Subject: [PATCH 375/443] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on 0374: say when
 the move was cut or pinned, word waiting chats apart

The toast counts skipped chats by reason past three, names chats the server was still switching apart from those waiting on a reply, and says when the server stopped at its row cap. The server half is in packages/ae_omni_policies.
---
 web/src/lib/aeClaudeAccount.test.ts | 25 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 web/src/lib/aeClaudeAccount.ts      | 28 +++++++++++++++++++++-------
 2 files changed, 46 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/web/src/lib/aeClaudeAccount.test.ts b/web/src/lib/aeClaudeAccount.test.ts
